{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Sea Arena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Deep Sea Arena, an intense underwater arena shooter where deadly creatures emerge from the abyss. Battle relentless waves of deep-sea horrors, dodge ambushes, and fight to stay alive. How long can you survive the depths?<br><br><strong>Fast-Paced Arena Shooter:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ever-Descending Platform:</strong> Your battleground continuously sinks into the ocean depths, ramping up tension as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Depth-Based Highscores:</strong> The deeper you manage to survive, the higher your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escalating Difficulty:</strong> Face increasingly dangerous waves of enemies as pressure, darkness, and limited space intensify.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Constant Action:</strong> Quick reflexes and strategic movement are key\u2014there\u2019s no safe corner in this relentless descent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Enemies:</strong> Encounter a variety of <strong>deep-sea creatures</strong>, each with unique attack patterns.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183330/extras/DeepSeaArena.jpg?t=1741646716\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183330?t=1741646716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741646716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183330/ba677bf3315a343cb4a587b090d2e74d2e97f1e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741646716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183330/ba677bf3315a343cb4a587b090d2e74d2e97f1e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741646716","categories":[{"d